From 1f52611be29979c4742d277b458f88cf6f960729 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:21:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 44/71] test(beacon): trusted relay allow-list for relayed
 beacons (RED)

Config validation for beacon_trusted_relays, peer-table accept/refuse
decisions for relayed beacons, and a netns datagram sent by a relay that
advertises another host's URL. The API is stubbed, so these fail.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
